; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR RACE CONDITION  -  VM1: the counter, round control, scores   (loads at $4000)
; ==========================================================================
; Load BOTH programs - Race-VM1.lst at $4000 and Race-VM2.lst at $5000 - then
; cold-boot. VM1 and VM2 each add 1 to a shared counter 500 times (READ it, ADD
; one, WRITE it back). Round 1 has no lock and loses updates when the scheduler
; switches VMs between a read and its write; round 2 wraps the three opcodes in
; $C7 SETMULTI 00 / 01 and gets exactly 1000. VM1 prints the scores.
;
; The counter is in VM1's memory (relative $0F00); VM1 opens it with $D0 SHAREVM
; read/write, and VM2 uses the cross-VM copies $D4 COPYVMXY / $D5 COPYXVMY.
; GO ($0F02) and DONE ($0F04) words coordinate the rounds; Race-VM1.lst clears
; them in its D-lines so leftovers from an earlier run cannot start a round early.
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/race_verify.py, V0061.33, two-VM cold boot): round 1 loses 196 of 1000 (got 804), round 2 gets exactly 1000; the loss is deterministic (opcode-count scheduler), so the Elf2K should show the same 196.
; NOT YET RUN ON HARDWARE.
;
; 106 STELLAR commands.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START
; D 4001 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A
; D 4005 D0 12          SHAREVM on, read/write             Let VM2 reach the counter
; D 4007 11 03 0F 02    LOADXI R3 0F02
; D 400B 32 03 00 00    COPYMX2I R3 0000                   Nothing started yet
; D 400F 11 03 0F 00    LOADXI R3 0F00
; D 4013 32 03 00 00    COPYMX2I R3 0000                   Counter = 0
; D 4017 11 0E 0C 00    LOADXI R14 0C00
; D 401B C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 401D 11 03 0F 02    LOADXI R3 0F02
; D 4021 32 03 00 01    COPYMX2I R3 0001                   GO round 1
; D 4025 11 05 01 F4    LOADXI R5 01F4
; D 4029 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; D 402D 11 0A 0F 00    LOADXI R10 0F00
; L1:
; D 4031 39 02 AB       COPYMXY M(R10) -> R11              READ the counter
; D 4034 42 0B          INCX R11                           ADD one
; D 4036 3A 02 BA       COPYXMY R11 -> M(R10)              WRITE it back
; D 4039 43 06          DECX R6
; D 403B 8C 06          TESTXZ R6
; D 403D A1 00 46       IFFALSEI N1
; D 4040 CA 31          SEROUTI 31 '1'                     A mark every 50 adds
; D 4042 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; N1:
; D 4046 43 05          DECX R5
; D 4048 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 404A A1 00 31       IFFALSEI L1
; D 404D 11 03 0F 04    LOADXI R3 0F04
; W1:
; D 4051 39 02 34       COPYMXY M(R3) -> R4
; D 4054 86 04 00 01    TESTXI R4 0001
; D 4058 A1 00 51       IFFALSEI W1                        Wait for VM2
; D 405B BD 00 BB       CALL RESULT
; D 405E 11 03 0F 00    LOADXI R3 0F00
; D 4062 32 03 00 00    COPYMX2I R3 0000                   Counter = 0 again
; D 4066 11 0E 0D 15    LOADXI R14 0D15
; D 406A C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 406C 11 03 0F 02    LOADXI R3 0F02
; D 4070 32 03 00 02    COPYMX2I R3 0002                   GO round 2
; D 4074 11 05 01 F4    LOADXI R5 01F4
; D 4078 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; D 407C 11 0A 0F 00    LOADXI R10 0F00
; L2:
; D 4080 C7 00          SETMULTI 00                        Lock: no switching from here ...
; D 4082 39 02 AB       COPYMXY M(R10) -> R11              READ the counter
; D 4085 42 0B          INCX R11                           ADD one
; D 4087 3A 02 BA       COPYXMY R11 -> M(R10)              WRITE it back
; D 408A C7 01          SETMULTI 01                        ... to here
; D 408C 43 06          DECX R6
; D 408E 8C 06          TESTXZ R6
; D 4090 A1 00 99       IFFALSEI N2
; D 4093 CA 31          SEROUTI 31 '1'                     A mark every 50 adds
; D 4095 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; N2:
; D 4099 43 05          DECX R5
; D 409B 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 409D A1 00 80       IFFALSEI L2
; D 40A0 11 03 0F 04    LOADXI R3 0F04
; W2:
; D 40A4 39 02 34       COPYMXY M(R3) -> R4
; D 40A7 86 04 00 02    TESTXI R4 0002
; D 40AB A1 00 A4       IFFALSEI W2                        Wait for VM2
; D 40AE BD 00 BB       CALL RESULT
; D 40B1 11 0E 0D F0    LOADXI R14 0DF0
; D 40B5 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 40B7 00             HALT                               VM1 finished
; D 40B8 F0 00 00       BREAK                              End marker
; RESULT:
; D 40BB 11 0E 0D B3    LOADXI R14 0DB3
; D 40BF C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 40C1 11 04 03 E8    LOADXI R4 03E8
; D 40C5 BD 01 00       CALL PRNUM
; D 40C8 11 0E 0D C1    LOADXI R14 0DC1
; D 40CC C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 40CE 11 03 0F 00    LOADXI R3 0F00
; D 40D2 39 02 34       COPYMXY M(R3) -> R4
; D 40D5 23 00 47       COPYXY R4 -> R7                    R7 = got
; D 40D8 BD 01 00       CALL PRNUM
; D 40DB 11 04 03 E8    LOADXI R4 03E8
; D 40DF 51 47 04       SUBXYZ R4 - R7 -> R4               R4 = lost
; D 40E2 8C 04          TESTXZ R4
; D 40E4 A1 00 EF       IFFALSEI RLOST
; D 40E7 11 0E 0D D2    LOADXI R14 0DD2
; D 40EB C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 40ED BE 00          RETURN
; RLOST:
; D 40EF 11 0E 0D C9    LOADXI R14 0DC9
; D 40F3 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 40F5 BD 01 00       CALL PRNUM
; D 40F8 11 0E 0D E4    LOADXI R14 0DE4
; D 40FC C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 40FE BE 00          RETURN
; PRNUM:
; D 4100 11 09 03 E8    LOADXI R9 03E8
; D 4104 4D 49          DIVXY R4 / R9
; D 4106 25             COPYMAA
; D 4107 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 410A C9             SEROUT
; D 410B 27             COPYREMA
; D 410C 21 04          COPYAX Acc -> R4
; D 410E 11 09 00 64    LOADXI R9 0064
; D 4112 4D 49          DIVXY R4 / R9
; D 4114 25             COPYMAA
; D 4115 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4118 C9             SEROUT
; D 4119 27             COPYREMA
; D 411A 21 04          COPYAX Acc -> R4
; D 411C 4D 4F          DIVXY R4 / R15
; D 411E 25             COPYMAA
; D 411F 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4122 C9             SEROUT
; D 4123 27             COPYREMA
; D 4124 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4127 C9             SEROUT
; D 4128 BE 00          RETURN

; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; CODE  -  download this block
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

